### AnalytixLabs API — Phase 2 surface
### Open in VSCode REST Client. Server defaults to http://localhost:3000.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Site settings (singleton)
GET {{base}}/api/site-settings

### Top navigation
GET {{base}}/api/nav?group=TOP_NAV

### Mega menu
GET {{base}}/api/nav?group=MEGA_MENU

### Footer links
GET {{base}}/api/nav?group=FOOTER_LINKS

### Footer city links
GET {{base}}/api/nav?group=FOOTER_CITIES

### Categories
GET {{base}}/api/categories

### Courses — full list
GET {{base}}/api/courses

### Courses — featured only, limit 4
GET {{base}}/api/courses?featured=true&limit=4

### Courses — by category slug
GET {{base}}/api/courses?category=data-science

### Course detail
GET {{base}}/api/courses/data-science

### Testimonials
GET {{base}}/api/testimonials

### Hiring partners
GET {{base}}/api/hiring-partners

### Team
GET {{base}}/api/team

### FAQs (global)
GET {{base}}/api/faqs?scope=GLOBAL

### FAQs (about page)
GET {{base}}/api/faqs?scope=ABOUT

### FAQs for a course
GET {{base}}/api/faqs?courseSlug=data-science

### Blog posts
GET {{base}}/api/posts?limit=10

### Blog post detail
GET {{base}}/api/posts/some-slug

### Editable Page block (about, why-us, etc.)
GET {{base}}/api/pages/about

### Active masterclass banner
GET {{base}}/api/masterclass/active

### Offices
GET {{base}}/api/offices

### Lead — contact form
POST {{base}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Person",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "message": "Sample contact message",
  "source": "contact-form"
}

### Lead — corporate enquiry
POST {{base}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Corporate Lead",
  "email": "corp@example.com",
  "company": "Acme Inc",
  "teamSize": "20-50",
  "source": "corporate-enquiry"
}

### Admin — login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@alabs.local",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Admin — current session
GET {{base}}/api/admin/auth/me

### Admin — logout
POST {{base}}/api/admin/auth/logout

### Admin — upload (multipart). VSCode REST Client supports file refs.
# POST {{base}}/api/admin/uploads
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary
#
# ------boundary
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="logo.png"
# Content-Type: image/png
#
# < ./public/uploads/sample.png
# ------boundary--
